## Phase 1: Core Commerce (4 actions)

### 1.1 Create Product — `create-product.ts`

**API endpoint:** `POST /admin/api/products`  
**JSON:API type:** `products`

**Props:**

| Prop Name              | Type                                       | Required | Description                                                            |
|------------------------|--------------------------------------------|----------|------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `sku`                  | `ShortText`                                | ✅        | Product SKU code                                                       |
| `status`               | `StaticDropdown`                           | ✅        | `enabled` / `disabled` (default: `disabled`)                           |
| `productType`          | `StaticDropdown`                           | No       | `simple` / `configurable` / `kit` (default: `simple`)                  |
| `featured`             | `Checkbox`                                 | No       | Mark as featured                                                       |
| `newArrival`           | `Checkbox`                                 | No       | Mark as new arrival                                                    |
| `availabilityDate`     | `ShortText`                                | No       | YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ                                                   |
| `categorySortOrder`    | `Number`                                   | No       | Sort order in catalog category                                         |
| `productName`          | `ShortText`                                | ✅        | Default-locale product name (creates `productnames` included resource) |
| `productDescription`   | `LongText`                                 | No       | Default-locale description (creates `productdescriptions` included)    |
| `shortDescription`     | `LongText`                                 | No       | Default-locale short description                                       |
| `attributeFamily`      | **New dropdown** `attributeFamilyDropdown` | ✅        | Required relationship                                                  |
| `productUnit`          | Existing `productUnitDropdown`             | ✅        | Primary unit (creates `productunitprecisions` included)                |
| `unitPrecision`        | `Number`                                   | No       | Decimal precision for the primary unit (default: 0)                    |
| `inventoryStatus`      | **New dropdown** `inventoryStatusDropdown` | No       | In Stock / Out of Stock                                                |
| `category`             | **New dropdown** `categoryDropdown`        | No       | Master catalog category                                                |
| `brand`                | **New dropdown** `brandDropdown`           | No       | Product brand                                                          |
| `taxCode`              | **New dropdown** `productTaxCodeDropdown`  | No       | Product tax code                                                       |
| `organization`         | Existing `organizationDropdown`            | No       |                                                                        |
| `owner`                | Existing `userDropdown`                    | No       |                                                                        |
| `additionalAttributes` | Existing                                   | No       |                                                                        |
| `additionalRelations`  | Existing                                   | No       |                                                                        |

**Implementation notes:**

- Product creation requires `included` resources for localized fields (`productnames`, `productdescriptions`, `productshortdescriptions`). Each included resource must have:
  ```json
  {
    "type": "productnames",
    "id": "product_name_default",
    "attributes": { "string": "Product Name", "fallback": null },
    "relationships": { "localization": { "data": null } }
  }
  ```
  Setting `localization.data` to `null` means "default locale."
- `primaryUnitPrecision` requires an included `productunitprecisions` resource:
  ```json
  {
    "type": "productunitprecisions",
    "id": "primary_unit",
    "attributes": { "precision": 0, "conversionRate": 1, "sell": true },
    "relationships": { "unit": { "data": { "type": "productunits", "id": "each" } } }
  }
  ```
- The relationship linkage for names/descriptions/shortDescriptions is an array of `{ type, id }` refs pointing to the included resources.

**New dropdowns needed in `props.ts`:**

```
attributeFamilyDropdown → makeSearchableDropdown, /attributefamilies, fieldsParam: 'id,code', searchExpr: code ~ "q", labelFn: attrLabel('code'), required: true
productTaxCodeDropdown → makeSearchableDropdown, /producttaxcodes, fieldsParam: 'id,code', searchExpr: code ~ "q", labelFn: attrLabel('code')
inventoryStatusDropdown → makeEnumDropdown, /productinventorystatuses, labelFn: attrLabel('name')
categoryDropdown → makeSearchableDropdown, /mastercatalogcategories, fieldsParam: 'id,title', searchExpr: title ~ "q", labelFn: attrLabel('title')
brandDropdown → makeSearchableDropdown, /brands, fieldsParam: 'id', searchExpr: allText ~ "q", labelFn: item => item.id
```

### 1.2 Update Product — `update-product.ts`

**API endpoint:** `PATCH /admin/api/products/{id}`  
**JSON:API type:** `products`

**Props:** Same as Create Product but:

- Add `productId` (`ShortText`, required) — the ID to update
- All other fields become optional (including `sku`, `attributeFamily`)
- `productName`, `productDescription`, `shortDescription` — if provided, send as included resources same as create

