## Phase 2: B2B Workflow (2 actions)

### 2.1 Create Quote — `create-quote.ts`

**API endpoint:** `POST /admin/api/quotes`  
**JSON:API type:** `quotes`

**Attributes from spec:**

- `currency`, `poNumber`, `validUntil`, `shipUntil`, `projectName`

**Relationships from spec:**

- `customer` (customers), `customerUser` (customerusers), `organization` (organizations), `owner` (users), `website` (websites)
- `internalStatus` (quoteinternalstatuses), `customerStatus` (quotecustomerstatuses)
- `opportunity` (opportunities), `paymentTerm` (paymentterms)
- `quoteProducts` (quoteproducts) — line items via included resources
- `shippingAddress` (quoteshippingaddresses) — inline included address

**Props:**

| Prop Name              | Type                                   | Required           |
|------------------------|----------------------------------------|--------------------|
| `currency`             | `ShortText`                            | ✅ (default: 'USD') |
| `customer`             | `customerRequiredDropdown`             | ✅                  |
| `poNumber`             | `ShortText`                            | No                 |
| `validUntil`           | `ShortText`                            | No                 |
| `shipUntil`            | `ShortText`                            | No                 |
| `projectName`          | `ShortText`                            | No                 |
| `customerUser`         | `customerUserDropdown(false)`          | No                 |
| `organization`         | `organizationDropdown`                 | No                 |
| `owner`                | `userDropdown`                         | No                 |
| `website`              | `websiteDropdown`                      | No                 |
| `internalStatus`       | **New** `quoteInternalStatusDropdown`  | No                 |
| `customerStatus`       | **New** `quoteCustomerStatusDropdown`  | No                 |
| `opportunity`          | **New** `opportunityDropdown`          | No                 |
| `paymentTerm`          | `paymentTermDropdown`                  | No                 |
| `shippingAddress*`     | Address fields (same pattern as order) | No                 |
| `lineItems`            | `DynamicProperties` → `Property.Array` | ✅                  |
| `additionalAttributes` | Existing                               | No                 |
| `additionalRelations`  | Existing                               | No                 |

**Line item sub-props** (inside `Property.Array`):

- `productSku` (ShortText, required), `productId` (ShortText), `freeFormProduct` (ShortText)
- `comment` (LongText)
- Quote products have `quoteProductOffers` which specify price tiers — each offer has: `quantity` (Number, required), `value` (Number, required), `currency` (ShortText), `productUnit` (StaticDropdown from fetched units), `allowIncrements` (Checkbox)

**Included resources structure:**

```json
{
    "type": "quoteproducts",
    "id": "qp_1",
    "attributes": {
        "comment": "...",
        "freeFormProduct": "..."
    },
    "relationships": {
        "product": {
            "data": {
                "type": "products",
                "id": "42"
            }
        },
        "quoteProductOffers": {
            "data": [
                {
                    "type": "quoteproductoffers",
                    "id": "qpo_1_1"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
```

And each offer:

```json
{
    "type": "quoteproductoffers",
    "id": "qpo_1_1",
    "attributes": {
        "quantity": 10,
        "value": "99.99",
        "currency": "USD",
        "allowIncrements": false
    },
    "relationships": {
        "productUnit": {
            "data": {
                "type": "productunits",
                "id": "each"
            }
        }
    }
}
```

**New dropdowns needed:**

```
quoteInternalStatusDropdown → makeEnumDropdown, /quoteinternalstatuses, labelFn: attrLabel('name')
quoteCustomerStatusDropdown → makeEnumDropdown, /quotecustomerstatuses, labelFn: attrLabel('name')
opportunityDropdown → makeSearchableDropdown, /opportunities, fieldsParam: 'id,name', searchExpr: name ~ "q", labelFn: attrLabel('name')
```

### 2.2 Create RFQ — `create-rfq.ts`

**API endpoint:** `POST /admin/api/rfqs`  
**JSON:API type:** `rfqs`

**Attributes from spec:**

- `firstName`, `lastName`, `email`, `company`, `phone`, `role`
- `poNumber`, `note`, `shipUntil`, `projectName`

**Relationships:**

- `customer` (customers), `customerUser` (customerusers), `organization` (organizations), `owner` (users), `website` (websites)
- `internal_status` (rfqinternalstatuses), `customer_status` (rfqcustomerstatuses)
- `requestProducts` (rfqproducts) — line items via included

**Props:**

| Prop Name              | Type                          | Required |
|------------------------|-------------------------------|----------|
| `firstName`            | `ShortText`                   | ✅        |
| `lastName`             | `ShortText`                   | ✅        |
| `email`                | `ShortText`                   | ✅        |
| `company`              | `ShortText`                   | No       |
| `phone`                | `ShortText`                   | No       |
| `role`                 | `ShortText`                   | No       |
| `poNumber`             | `ShortText`                   | No       |
| `note`                 | `LongText`                    | No       |
| `shipUntil`            | `ShortText`                   | No       |
| `projectName`          | `ShortText`                   | No       |
| `customer`             | `customerDropdown`            | No       |
| `customerUser`         | `customerUserDropdown(false)` | No       |
| `organization`         | `organizationDropdown`        | No       |
| `owner`                | `userDropdown`                | No       |
| `website`              | `websiteDropdown`             | No       |
| `lineItems`            | `Property.Array`              | No       |
| `additionalAttributes` | Existing                      | No       |
| `additionalRelations`  | Existing                      | No       |

**Line item sub-props:**

- `productSku` (ShortText, required), `productId` (ShortText), `comment` (LongText)
- Each RFQ product has `rfqProductItems` — each item has: `quantity` (Number, required), `value` (Number), `currency` (ShortText), `productUnit` (ShortText — use code like "each")

**Included resources:**

```json
{
    "type": "rfqproducts",
    "id": "rp_1",
    "relationships": {
        "product": {
            "data": {
                "type": "products",
                "id": "42"
            }
        },
        "requestProductItems": {
            "data": [
                {
                    "type": "rfqproductitems",
                    "id": "rpi_1_1"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
```

